    "text": "Let F be a non-abelian free pro-p group of finite rank. Can one find a finite\ncollection U1 , . . . , Un of open subgroups of F including F itself such that the only\nsubgroup of F which is contained in Ui and is characteristic in Ui for every i is the\ntrivial subgroup?                                                             Y. Barnea",
